        "type": "nodetool.workflows.base_node.Comment",
        "data": {
          "comment": "# Generate a Silent Bed\n\nMakes a silent audio track of a fixed length. Use it as spacing between joined takes or as a placeholder until the real voiceover exists.\n\n**How it works:** \"Silence\" creates three seconds of silence at 44,100 Hz, and \"Silent track\" shows the result. There are no inputs, and it runs locally with no model or key.\n\n**Try this:** Set the duration on \"Silence\" to match the gap you need, such as 0.5 seconds between two narration takes, and change the sample rate to 48000 if your video project uses it."
        },
